:volu world BOX 500*cm 500*cm 500*cm G4_Galactic
:vis world OFF
:volu room BOX 50*cm 50*cm 50*cm G4_Galactic
:vis room OFF
:rotm r000 0 0 0
:rotm r90x 90 0 180 0 90 90
:volu cryostat TUBE 4.8*cm 5*cm 5.25*cm G4_Galactic
:vis cryostat OFF
:volu cryo_vacuum TUBE 0 4.75*cm 5*cm G4_Galactic
:vis cryo_vacuum OFF
